## Action input format
- Manager/tool call: `action_input` is the arguments — a JSON object emitted as a string for a leaf
  tool, or a plain-prose task for a manager ("Research X; return …").
- `return_control`: `action_input` may be empty or a one-line summary — your real output goes in `findings`.

## Output fields
what_i_am_thinking · checklist (your subtasks) · findings (results recorded on the node) · info_for_others · plan · action · action_input
